sequenceDiagram
    title SD-02 - Student Registration
    participant P0 as Admin Staff
    participant P1 as Student UI
    participant P2 as Student Service
    participant P3 as Student Repository
    participant P4 as Database
    P0->>P1: Submit student details
    P1->>P2: registerStudent(data)
    P2->>P2: Authorize + validate fields
    P2->>P3: checkStudentNumber(number)
    P3->>P4: SELECT uniqueness
    P4->>P3: Exists / not exists
    P3->>P2: Result
    P2->>P3: beginTransaction(), insertStudent()
    P3->>P4: INSERT student, COMMIT
    P4->>P3: StudentID / failure
    P3->>P2: Created student / error
    Note over P2: alt: success or validation error
    P1->>P0: Show result
